SUMMARY:Tech Lancaster Meetup
DESCRIPTION:Tech Lancaster Meetups\nWe will be upstairs in "The Sanctuary"
  - when you walk in the main entrance just head up the stairs! We will hav
 e signs as you walk in to guide you.\nPizza is provided free upstairs. Bee
 r/wine/soda/etc at the bar downstairs!\n\nThis months speakers:\n**Eric Sa
 uder - *SolarPunk Lancaster***\n\n**TBA**\nHave something you want to shar
 e? Lets us know and maybe fill in a hole!\n\nTypical schedule of events:\n
 \n6:30 PM Doors Open/Pizza/Mingle\n7:00 PM Introduction/Announcements\n7:0
 5 PM First Speaker\n7:35 PM Break\n7:45 PM Speaker 2\n8:15 PM End
